---
/**
 * Loads `<al-theme>` — the scoped theming host every page in this site wraps
 * its content in.
 *
 * A DEEP import, not the full bundle: the theme host is the one element every
 * page needs (component detail pages load the rest through LiveRuntime.astro),
 * and `al-web-components/components/theme` is a literal specifier, so Vite can
 * statically analyse it and ship a few kB instead of the whole library on the
 * Overview and Foundations screens.
 *
 * Registration is the flag path from `.altitude/REGISTRATION.md`:
 * `window.alAutoRegistry = true` is set inline in <head> (Shell.astro) before
 * this module evaluates, and the module reads it at module-eval time to decide
 * whether to call `customElements.define`. When the full bundle also loads, its
 * own `customElements.get(...) === undefined` guard means whichever arrives
 * first wins and the second is a no-op.
 */
---

<script>
  import 'al-web-components/components/theme';
</script>
